                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Amubone! Ndaletela Turo Nebukadinezara mwami wa-Babuloni, mwami wabami, uuzwa kulubazu lwakunyika, Uleza ambizi ankalaki abasimabbiza amakamu makamu aabantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
