          "text": "Mbuboobu Mwami Jehova mbwaambila Turo, Inkomwe zyalwizi sa tazikooyoozungaana, muzumo wabuwe bwako nuuyoomvwigwa, bayasidwe nibayootongela, bantu nibayoojayigwa mukati kako? ",
