        {
          "text": "Bami boonse bakulwizi bayooseluka kuzwa kuzyuuno zyabo, bayoosamununa zikobela zyabo akugwisya zyakusama zyabo zyamanyengwe manyengwe, bayoosama buyoofu, bayookala ansi, bayookankama ciindi coonse cakugamba nduwe. ",
